        <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20a%20private%20airport%20transfer." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg" style="color: #fff; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">
          💬 WhatsApp Live Ops (+255 672 450 934)
